	(descr "XKB Connection TS-1101VS-x-A-A side-actuated SMD tactile switch with two locating pegs, body 7.0x2.5 mm, 3.45 mm high, actuator 3.0x1.5 mm pointing to -Y and protruding 1.0 mm. Land pattern per XKB drawing TS-1101VS-B-A-A rev A1. Origin is midway between the pegs. Pads SH are the metal cover legs. Keep the board edge on the Cmts.User line or further out. LCSC C561499 (TS-1101VS-B-A-A, 160 gf), alternative C318936 (TS-1101VS-C-A-A, 260 gf).")
